{"id":"level-up-2026-09-27","name":"2026-09-27 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s451","en":"He filled a bucket with water for the thirsty plants.","zh":"他装满了一桶水，准备浇灌缺水的植物。","note":"bucket · 水桶 · a bucket of water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s452","en":"A senior colleague helped me prepare for my first lecture.","zh":"一位资深同事帮我准备了第一堂课。","note":"senior · 资格较老的；年长的；较年长者； 毕业班学生 · a senior colleague","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s453","en":"The bottle's label clearly states the dose prescribed for each patient.","zh":"瓶身标签清楚标明了为每位患者开具的剂量。","note":"dose · 剂量， 一剂 · a small dose","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s454","en":"Try not to smear the wet paint with your sleeve.","zh":"尽量别让袖子抹花尚未干的油漆。","note":"smear · 胡乱涂抹；弄脏，弄污；诽谤，诋毁；变得模糊不清， · smear paint","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s455","en":"An extendable table gives us extra space when friends visit.","zh":"朋友来访时，可伸展的桌子能提供额外空间。","note":"extendable · 可延伸的， 可展开的， 可扩张的 · an extendable table","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s456","en":"My cousin practises Kung Fu at the community centre every Saturday.","zh":"我的表弟每周六在社区中心练功夫。","note":"Kung Fu · 功夫 · practise Kung Fu","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s457","en":"A relative in Edinburgh offered us a place to stay.","zh":"爱丁堡的一位亲戚给我们提供了住处。","note":"relative · 相对的；比较的；有关的，相关的；亲属， 亲戚 · a close relative","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s458","en":"Her positive attitude helped the group through a difficult rehearsal.","zh":"她积极的态度帮助小组度过了一次艰难的排练。","note":"attitude · 态度， 看法； 姿势 · a positive attitude","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s459","en":"The journey takes an average of forty minutes each morning.","zh":"每天早晨，这段路程平均需要四十分钟。","note":"average · 平均的；平常的，普通的；平均达到； 平均为；平均 · on average","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s460","en":"The students asked for fair treatment when applying for scholarships.","zh":"学生们要求在申请奖学金时获得公平对待。","note":"treatment · 治疗； 对待 · fair treatment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s461","en":"The chart uses patterns so colour-blind readers can distinguish categories.","zh":"图表使用纹理，让色盲读者也能区分不同类别。","note":"colour-blind · 色盲的 · colour-blind users","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s462","en":"We should compare prices before buying the new printer.","zh":"购买新打印机前，我们应该比较一下价格。","note":"compare · 比较； 对比 · compare prices","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s463","en":"Her influential essays changed how readers understood the city's history.","zh":"她那些颇有影响力的文章改变了读者对这座城市历史的理解。","note":"influential · 有影响力的； 有权势的 · an influential writer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s464","en":"Applicants asked for a more transparent process for awarding grants.","zh":"申请者要求补助金的分配过程更加透明。","note":"transparent · 透明的， 清澈的； 明显的； 易懂的 · a transparent process","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s465","en":"The model helped students grasp the structure of the building.","zh":"这个模型帮助学生理解了建筑的结构。","note":"grasp · 抓紧；掌握，全面理解；抓住； 支配； 理解 · grasp a concept","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s466","en":"The team submitted its findings to a respected academic journal.","zh":"团队向一家备受认可的学术期刊提交了研究结果。","note":"journal · 杂志； 日报； 日志 · an academic journal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s467","en":"The painter developed a distinctive style using broad curved lines.","zh":"画家运用宽阔的曲线，形成了独特的风格。","note":"distinctive · 出众的； 有特色的 · a distinctive style","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s468","en":"The experiment compared the chemical composition of three rock samples.","zh":"实验比较了三份岩石样本的化学成分。","note":"composition · 作品； 写作， 作曲； 结构， 组成， 成分 · chemical composition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s469","en":"The shop received a consignment of handmade bowls this morning.","zh":"商店今早收到了一批托运来的手工碗。","note":"consignment · 交付， 委托； 投递， 发送； 所托运的货物 · a consignment of goods","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s470","en":"The gardener uses compost to fertilise the soil each spring.","zh":"园丁每年春天用堆肥给土壤施肥。","note":"fertilise · 使肥沃， 使多产； 施肥于； 使受精 · fertilise the soil","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s471","en":"The guide showed us photographs of the island's active volcano.","zh":"导游给我们看了岛上活火山的照片。","note":"volcano · 火山 · an active volcano","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s472","en":"The seminar explores the role of play in language acquisition.","zh":"研讨会探讨游戏在语言习得中的作用。","note":"acquisition · 取得； 获得物 · language acquisition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s473","en":"The rigid schedule left little time for questions after lectures.","zh":"死板的时间安排让讲座后几乎没有时间提问。","note":"rigid · 严格的， 死板的； 刚硬的， 僵硬的 · a rigid schedule","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s474","en":"We worked together to meet the deadline for the exhibition.","zh":"我们齐心协力，赶上了展览的截止时间。","note":"deadline · 最后期限 · meet a deadline","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s475","en":"The sociology class debated how societies define deviance differently.","zh":"社会学课上讨论了不同社会如何以不同方式界定偏常行为。","note":"deviance · 异常； 偏常行为 · social deviance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s476","en":"I am grateful for your help with the difficult application.","zh":"感谢你帮助我处理这份复杂的申请。","note":"grateful · 感激的， 感谢的 · grateful for help","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s477","en":"The retailer agreed to replace the damaged lamp free of charge.","zh":"零售商同意免费更换损坏的灯。","note":"retailer · 零售商人； 复述者， 传播者 · an online retailer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s478","en":"The advent of cheap cameras changed everyday family photography.","zh":"廉价相机的出现改变了日常家庭摄影。","note":"advent · 到来； 出现 · the advent of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s479","en":"The medieval castle overlooks a narrow valley beside the river.","zh":"这座中世纪城堡俯瞰着河边一条狭窄的山谷。","note":"medieval · 中世纪的； 中古的 · a medieval castle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s480","en":"The new ticket machines should be fully operational by Monday.","zh":"新售票机应该会在周一前完全投入运行。","note":"operational · 运转的； 操作的； 运营的， 业务的 · fully operational","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s481","en":"The staff discussed opening hours at their weekly meeting.","zh":"员工们在每周例会上讨论了开放时间。","note":"staff · 全体职工，工作人员；棒；全体参谋人员；为…配备人员； 任职于 · a staff meeting","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s482","en":"The project aims to involve local residents in garden design.","zh":"这个项目旨在让当地居民参与花园设计。","note":"involve · 使卷入， 使参与； 牵涉， 陷入， 连累； 包含， 含有 · involve the community","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s483","en":"An enormous tanker passed slowly through the harbour entrance.","zh":"一艘巨大的油轮缓缓驶过港口入口。","note":"tanker · 油轮； 油罐车； 加油飞机 · an oil tanker","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s484","en":"Applicants must demonstrate the requisite skills during a practical assessment.","zh":"申请者必须在实践考核中展示所需技能。","note":"requisite · 需要的；必要的；必需品； 要素 · the requisite skills","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s485","en":"The building project is still at an early stage.","zh":"这个建筑项目仍处于早期阶段。","note":"stage · 舞台； 戏剧； 阶段 · an early stage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s486","en":"Booking the equipment turned out to be surprisingly complicated.","zh":"预订设备原来出奇地复杂。","note":"complicated · 复杂的； 难懂的 · a complicated process","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s487","en":"The new digital catalogue will supersede the old paper index.","zh":"新的数字目录将取代旧纸质索引。","note":"supersede · 代替， 取代 · supersede an older model","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s488","en":"The hall reached its maximum capacity before the concert began.","zh":"音乐会开始前，礼堂就已达到最大容纳人数。","note":"maximum · 最大的， 最高的；最大量，极限 · maximum capacity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s489","en":"The exhibition features photographs of desert landscapes at sunrise.","zh":"展览展示了日出时沙漠景观的照片。","note":"desert · 沙漠的；荒凉的[dI'zɜːt]；舍弃；沙漠；荒地 · a desert landscape","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s490","en":"Her grandmother taught her several songs in the local dialect.","zh":"祖母教了她几首用当地方言演唱的歌。","note":"dialect · 方言， 土语 · a local dialect","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s491","en":"Keep the emergency exit clear throughout the performance.","zh":"整个演出期间都要保持紧急出口畅通。","note":"emergency · 紧急情况， 突发事件 · an emergency exit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s492","en":"A faculty member helped organise the student research conference.","zh":"一位教师帮助组织了学生研究会议。","note":"faculty · 才能； 学院， 系； 全体教学人员 · a faculty member","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s493","en":"Remember to check your passport before booking the international flight.","zh":"预订国际航班前，记得检查护照。","note":"passport · 护照； 途径， 路子， 手段 · a valid passport","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s494","en":"The path follows the base of a pale limestone cliff.","zh":"小路沿着一面浅色石灰岩悬崖的底部延伸。","note":"limestone · 石灰石， 石灰岩 · a limestone cliff","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s495","en":"The exhibition captures the glamor of early Hollywood cinema.","zh":"展览呈现了早期好莱坞电影的魅力。","note":"glamor · 魅力； 诱惑力 · Hollywood glamor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s496","en":"Each camper received a map showing the nearest water point.","zh":"每位露营者都收到了一张标明最近取水点的地图。","note":"camper · 露营者， 宿营者 · an experienced camper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s497","en":"The faded inscription provided a clue to the portrait's identity.","zh":"褪色的题字为确认肖像人物的身份提供了线索。","note":"clue · 线索； 提示 · a vital clue","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s498","en":"The family raises livestock on the hills above the village.","zh":"这家人在村子上方的山坡上饲养牲畜。","note":"livestock · 〈总称〉 家畜， 牲畜 · raise livestock","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s499","en":"She studies legal history through records held in local archives.","zh":"她通过地方档案馆保存的记录研究法律史。","note":"legal · 法律的； 合法的 · legal history","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:s500","en":"We found a quiet garden in the midst of the city.","zh":"我们在城市中心发现了一座安静的花园。","note":"midst · 中间 · in the midst of","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:w451","en":"bucket","zh":"水桶","note":"英 /'bʌkɪt/ · 美 /'bʌkɪt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0451-uk-6443df778a5e.mp3","text":"bucket"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0451-us-34602fab9b20.mp3","text":"bucket"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:w452","en":"senior","zh":"资格较老的；年长的；较年长者； 毕业班学生","note":"英 /'siːnɪə(r)/ · 美 /'sinɪɚ/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0452-uk-ec82f7aa1fed.mp3","text":"senior"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0452-us-e1cb615c836d.mp3","text":"senior"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-27:w453","en":"dose","zh":"剂量， 一剂","note":"英 /dəus/ · 美 /dos/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0453-uk-9fa787eee14b.mp3","text":"dose"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0453-us-80610b95a182.mp